<span id="S3.T1.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Bernie Sanders n<span id="S3.T1.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;">Λ</span> Maine democratic caucus Ejt<span id="S3.T1.2.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;">Λ</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
